---
description: Resolve consent for each account span before follow-up or publication use.
args: { dossier: OralHistoryDossier; change: ArchiveChange; accounts: OralHistoryAccount[] }
returns: ConsentSpan[]
---
Bind consent to the speaker, interview, exact source span, permitted derivative uses and audience. Apply the latest authorized withdrawal immediately and keep unrelated spans separate. If consent authority or span scope is uncertain, withhold the affected derivative and preserve the question for archivist review.
